{"id":"db96cabedd089e5f","group":"73","path":"73/73-df-binary-program-coding.md","title":"Effective Binary Coding of Machines and Pairs","display":"df-effective-machine-encoding — Effective Binary Coding of Machines and Pairs","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-df-binary-program-coding","aliases":["73-df-binary-program-coding","73-df-effective-machine-encoding"],"display":"df-effective-machine-encoding — Effective Binary Coding of Machines and Pairs","depends_on":["[[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]","[[73-df-eight-tuple-dtm]]","[[73-df-dtm-language-semantics]]","[[73-df-dtm-language-decision]]","[[88-df-encoding]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-df-binary-program-coding"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-df-binary-program-coding</span><span>73-df-effective-machine-encoding</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-effective-machine-encoding — Effective Binary Coding of Machines and Pairs"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0a6da8c909717780\" href=\"?note=0a6da8c909717780\" title=\"73-df-finite-words-and-languages\">73-df-finite-words-and-languages</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a63442026b2f1a9a\" href=\"?note=a63442026b2f1a9a\" title=\"73-df-eight-tuple-dtm\">73-df-eight-tuple-dtm</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"888d8ab66ec7efca\" href=\"?note=888d8ab66ec7efca\" title=\"73-df-dtm-language-semantics\">73-df-dtm-language-semantics</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"004d4e2ba3fdd14e\" href=\"?note=004d4e2ba3fdd14e\" title=\"73-df-dtm-language-decision\">73-df-dtm-language-decision</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"3b05ff7db230d81f\" href=\"?note=3b05ff7db230d81f\" title=\"88-df-encoding\">88-df-encoding</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf 2=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\mathbf 2=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span> (binary alphabet)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{wordenc}:\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega}\\to\\mathbf 2^*\">\\(\\operatorname{wordenc}:\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega}\\to\\mathbf 2^*\\)</span> with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{WordCoding}(\\operatorname{wordenc})\">\\(\\operatorname{WordCoding}(\\operatorname{wordenc})\\)</span> (fixed tuple code, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"3b05ff7db230d81f\" href=\"?note=3b05ff7db230d81f\" title=\"88-df-encoding\">88-df-encoding</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lex}\">\\(\\mathrm{lex}\\)</span> (the lexicographic order on finite subsets of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N^2\">\\(\\mathbb N^2\\)</span>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{TM}}\">\\(\\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{TM}}\\)</span> (canonically numbered deterministic-machine descriptions)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E=(\\operatorname{wordenc},\\operatorname{code},\\operatorname{decode},\\operatorname{esc},\\operatorname{pair},\\operatorname{unpair})\">\\(\\mathcal E=(\\operatorname{wordenc},\\operatorname{code},\\operatorname{decode},\\operatorname{esc},\\operatorname{pair},\\operatorname{unpair})\\)</span> (coding package)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota:\\{\\mathsf L,\\mathsf R\\}\\to\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\iota:\\{\\mathsf L,\\mathsf R\\}\\to\\{0,1\\}\\)</span> 是本文件定义的方向编码函数，不是唯一描述算子；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_i\">\\(\\pi_i\\)</span> 为有限有序元组的第 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\">\\(i\\)</span> 个投影。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}effective\\text{-}machine\\text{-}encoding}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{CanonDTM}_{\\mathbf 2}(M)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists r,g\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists Q\\,\\exists\\Gamma\\,\\exists\\mathrm{blank}\\,\n\\exists\\delta\\,\\exists q_0,q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}}\\;\\Bigl[\nr,g\\geq3\n\\land M=(Q,\\mathbf 2,\\Gamma,\\mathrm{blank},\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}})\n\\land M\\in\\mathsf{DTM}_{\\mathbf 2}\n\\land Q=\\{0,\\ldots,r-1\\}\n\\land\\Gamma=\\{0,\\ldots,g-1\\}\n\\Bigr]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}effective\\text{-}machine\\text{-}encoding}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{CanonDTM}_{\\mathbf 2}(M)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists r,g\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists Q\\,\\exists\\Gamma\\,\\exists\\mathrm{blank}\\,\n\\exists\\delta\\,\\exists q_0,q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}}\\;\\Bigl[\nr,g\\geq3\n\\land M=(Q,\\mathbf 2,\\Gamma,\\mathrm{blank},\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}})\n\\land M\\in\\mathsf{DTM}_{\\mathbf 2}\n\\land Q=\\{0,\\ldots,r-1\\}\n\\land\\Gamma=\\{0,\\ldots,g-1\\}\n\\Bigr]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}effective\\text{-}machine\\text{-}encoding}\\vdash\n\\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{TM}}\\coloneqq\n\\{M\\in\\mathsf{DTM}_{\\mathbf 2}:\\operatorname{CanonDTM}_{\\mathbf 2}(M)\\},\n\\qquad\n\\iota(\\mathsf L)\\coloneqq0,\\quad\\iota(\\mathsf R)\\coloneqq1\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}effective\\text{-}machine\\text{-}encoding}\\vdash\n\\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{TM}}\\coloneqq\n\\{M\\in\\mathsf{DTM}_{\\mathbf 2}:\\operatorname{CanonDTM}_{\\mathbf 2}(M)\\},\n\\qquad\n\\iota(\\mathsf L)\\coloneqq0,\\quad\\iota(\\mathsf R)\\coloneqq1\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}effective\\text{-}machine\\text{-}encoding}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{TableCode}(M,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists r,g\\in\\mathbb N\\,\\exists Q\\,\\exists\\Gamma\\,\\exists\\mathrm{blank}\\,\n\\exists\\delta\\,\\exists q_0,q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}}\\,\n\\exists\\bigl((q_i,a_i)\\bigr)_{i=1}^{(r-2)g}\\;\\Biggl[\n\\begin{array}{l}\nM\\in\\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{TM}}\n\\land M=(Q,\\mathbf 2,\\Gamma,\\mathrm{blank},\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}})\\\\\n{}\\land Q=\\{0,\\ldots,r-1\\}\\land\\Gamma=\\{0,\\ldots,g-1\\}\\\\\n{}\\land \\bigl((q_i,a_i)\\bigr)_{i=1}^{(r-2)g}\n=\\bigl\\langle(q,a):(q,a)\\in\n(Q\\setminus\\{q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}}\\})\\times\\Gamma\n\\bigr\\rangle_{\\mathrm{lex}}\\\\\n{}\\land \\tau=\n\\langle r,g,\\mathrm{blank},q_0,q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}}\\rangle\n\\mathbin{\\frown}\n\\mathop{\\mathbin{\\frown}}\\limits_{i=1}^{(r-2)g}\n\\left\\langle\n\\pi_1\\delta(q_i,a_i),\\pi_2\\delta(q_i,a_i),\n\\iota(\\pi_3\\delta(q_i,a_i))\n\\right\\rangle\n\\end{array}\n\\Biggr]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}effective\\text{-}machine\\text{-}encoding}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{TableCode}(M,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists r,g\\in\\mathbb N\\,\\exists Q\\,\\exists\\Gamma\\,\\exists\\mathrm{blank}\\,\n\\exists\\delta\\,\\exists q_0,q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}}\\,\n\\exists\\bigl((q_i,a_i)\\bigr)_{i=1}^{(r-2)g}\\;\\Biggl[\n\\begin{array}{l}\nM\\in\\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{TM}}\n\\land M=(Q,\\mathbf 2,\\Gamma,\\mathrm{blank},\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}})\\\\\n{}\\land Q=\\{0,\\ldots,r-1\\}\\land\\Gamma=\\{0,\\ldots,g-1\\}\\\\\n{}\\land \\bigl((q_i,a_i)\\bigr)_{i=1}^{(r-2)g}\n=\\bigl\\langle(q,a):(q,a)\\in\n(Q\\setminus\\{q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}}\\})\\times\\Gamma\n\\bigr\\rangle_{\\mathrm{lex}}\\\\\n{}\\land \\tau=\n\\langle r,g,\\mathrm{blank},q_0,q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}}\\rangle\n\\mathbin{\\frown}\n\\mathop{\\mathbin{\\frown}}\\limits_{i=1}^{(r-2)g}\n\\left\\langle\n\\pi_1\\delta(q_i,a_i),\\pi_2\\delta(q_i,a_i),\n\\iota(\\pi_3\\delta(q_i,a_i))\n\\right\\rangle\n\\end{array}\n\\Biggr]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}effective\\text{-}machine\\text{-}encoding}\\vdash\n\\forall M\\in\\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{TM}}\\;\n\\exists!\\tau\\in\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\\operatorname{TableCode}(M,\\tau),\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{tab}:\\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{TM}}\\to\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega},\n\\qquad\n\\forall M\\in\\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{TM}}\\;\n\\operatorname{TableCode}(M,\\operatorname{tab}(M))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}effective\\text{-}machine\\text{-}encoding}\\vdash\n\\forall M\\in\\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{TM}}\\;\n\\exists!\\tau\\in\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\\operatorname{TableCode}(M,\\tau),\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{tab}:\\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{TM}}\\to\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega},\n\\qquad\n\\forall M\\in\\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{TM}}\\;\n\\operatorname{TableCode}(M,\\operatorname{tab}(M))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}effective\\text{-}machine\\text{-}encoding}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{esc}(\\varepsilon)\\coloneqq\\varepsilon,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{esc}(xb)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{esc}(x)\\,0b\n\\quad(x\\in\\mathbf 2^*,\\,b\\in\\mathbf 2)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}effective\\text{-}machine\\text{-}encoding}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{esc}(\\varepsilon)\\coloneqq\\varepsilon,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{esc}(xb)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{esc}(x)\\,0b\n\\quad(x\\in\\mathbf 2^*,\\,b\\in\\mathbf 2)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}effective\\text{-}machine\\text{-}encoding}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{pair}(x,y)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{esc}(x)\\,11\\,y\n\\quad(x,y\\in\\mathbf 2^*)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}effective\\text{-}machine\\text{-}encoding}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{pair}(x,y)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{esc}(x)\\,11\\,y\n\\quad(x,y\\in\\mathbf 2^*)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}effective\\text{-}machine\\text{-}encoding}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{MachineCoding}(\\mathcal E)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left[\n\\begin{array}{l}\n\\mathcal E=(\\operatorname{wordenc},\\operatorname{code},\\operatorname{decode},\n\\operatorname{esc},\\operatorname{pair},\\operatorname{unpair})\\\\\n{}\\land \\operatorname{WordCoding}(\\operatorname{wordenc})\n\\land\\operatorname{code}:\\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{TM}}\\hookrightarrow\\mathbf 2^*\\\\\n{}\\land \\forall M\\in\\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{TM}}\\;\n\\operatorname{code}(M)=\\operatorname{wordenc}(\\operatorname{tab}(M))\\\\\n{}\\land \\operatorname{ran}(\\operatorname{code})\\in\\mathsf{DEC}_{\\mathbf 2}\n\\land\\operatorname{decode}:\\operatorname{ran}(\\operatorname{code})\n\\to\\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{TM}}\\\\\n{}\\land \\operatorname{decode}\\circ\\operatorname{code}\n=\\operatorname{id}_{\\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{TM}}}\\\\\n{}\\land \\operatorname{pair}:(\\mathbf 2^*)^2\\hookrightarrow\\mathbf 2^*\n\\land\\operatorname{ran}(\\operatorname{pair})\\in\\mathsf{DEC}_{\\mathbf 2}\n\\land\\operatorname{unpair}:\\operatorname{ran}(\\operatorname{pair})\n\\to(\\mathbf 2^*)^2\\\\\n{}\\land \\operatorname{unpair}\\circ\\operatorname{pair}\n=\\operatorname{id}_{(\\mathbf 2^*)^2}\n\\end{array}\n\\right]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}effective\\text{-}machine\\text{-}encoding}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{MachineCoding}(\\mathcal E)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left[\n\\begin{array}{l}\n\\mathcal E=(\\operatorname{wordenc},\\operatorname{code},\\operatorname{decode},\n\\operatorname{esc},\\operatorname{pair},\\operatorname{unpair})\\\\\n{}\\land \\operatorname{WordCoding}(\\operatorname{wordenc})\n\\land\\operatorname{code}:\\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{TM}}\\hookrightarrow\\mathbf 2^*\\\\\n{}\\land \\forall M\\in\\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{TM}}\\;\n\\operatorname{code}(M)=\\operatorname{wordenc}(\\operatorname{tab}(M))\\\\\n{}\\land \\operatorname{ran}(\\operatorname{code})\\in\\mathsf{DEC}_{\\mathbf 2}\n\\land\\operatorname{decode}:\\operatorname{ran}(\\operatorname{code})\n\\to\\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{TM}}\\\\\n{}\\land \\operatorname{decode}\\circ\\operatorname{code}\n=\\operatorname{id}_{\\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{TM}}}\\\\\n{}\\land \\operatorname{pair}:(\\mathbf 2^*)^2\\hookrightarrow\\mathbf 2^*\n\\land\\operatorname{ran}(\\operatorname{pair})\\in\\mathsf{DEC}_{\\mathbf 2}\n\\land\\operatorname{unpair}:\\operatorname{ran}(\\operatorname{pair})\n\\to(\\mathbf 2^*)^2\\\\\n{}\\land \\operatorname{unpair}\\circ\\operatorname{pair}\n=\\operatorname{id}_{(\\mathbf 2^*)^2}\n\\end{array}\n\\right]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}effective\\text{-}machine\\text{-}encoding}\\vdash\n\\ulcorner M\\urcorner_{\\mathcal E}\\coloneqq\\operatorname{code}(M),\\qquad\n\\langle x,y\\rangle_{\\mathcal E}\\coloneqq\\operatorname{pair}(x,y)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}effective\\text{-}machine\\text{-}encoding}\\vdash\n\\ulcorner M\\urcorner_{\\mathcal E}\\coloneqq\\operatorname{code}(M),\\qquad\n\\langle x,y\\rangle_{\\mathcal E}\\coloneqq\\operatorname{pair}(x,y)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}effective\\text{-}machine\\text{-}encoding}\\vdash\n\\forall S\\in\\mathsf{DTM}_{\\mathbf 2}\\;\n\\exists M\\in\\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{TM}}\\;(L(S)=L(M))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}effective\\text{-}machine\\text{-}encoding}\\vdash\n\\forall S\\in\\mathsf{DTM}_{\\mathbf 2}\\;\n\\exists M\\in\\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{TM}}\\;(L(S)=L(M))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}effective\\text{-}machine\\text{-}encoding}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{tab}\\coloneqq\\{(M,\\tau)\\in \\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{TM}}\\times\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega}:\\operatorname{TableCode}(M,\\tau)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}effective\\text{-}machine\\text{-}encoding}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{tab}\\coloneqq\\{(M,\\tau)\\in \\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{TM}}\\times\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega}:\\operatorname{TableCode}(M,\\tau)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>State and tape alphabets are first renamed to finite initial segments. The lexicographically ordered transition table is then serialized by the fixed tuple code of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"3b05ff7db230d81f\" href=\"?note=3b05ff7db230d81f\" title=\"88-df-encoding\">88-df-encoding</a>, so the machine code is not an arbitrary injection.</li>\n<li>Pair decoding scans aligned two-bit blocks from the beginning: every prefix block is <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"00\">\\(00\\)</span> or <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"01\">\\(01\\)</span>, and the first aligned <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"11\">\\(11\\)</span> is the separator. An unaligned <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"11\">\\(11\\)</span> may cross the prefix boundary and is not a separator. The displayed recursions make pairing and unpairing effective, while the valid machine-code range is explicitly decidable.</li>\n<li>Canonical renaming preserves accepted languages, as stated by the last assertion. Every later index language is relative to this one package <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E\">\\(\\mathcal E\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-finite-words-and-languages","status":"resolved","id":"0a6da8c909717780","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-eight-tuple-dtm","status":"resolved","id":"a63442026b2f1a9a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-eight-tuple-dtm]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-dtm-language-semantics","status":"resolved","id":"888d8ab66ec7efca","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-dtm-language-semantics]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-dtm-language-decision","status":"resolved","id":"004d4e2ba3fdd14e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-dtm-language-decision]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-encoding","status":"resolved","id":"3b05ff7db230d81f","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-encoding]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-encoding","status":"resolved","id":"3b05ff7db230d81f","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnch